/apps/3815370/extras_big/b879e206b9458ccc732a95892ef7727d.webp?t=1788276914 width=1560 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/extras/e51a5f2ed043c79e2e8fe223c8f9853f.avif?t=1788276914\" width=1500 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talaka</strong> analyses your gameplay and suggests the ideal difficulty for your skill level. If you want full control, accessibility options are always available: infinite health, one-hit kills, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/extras/3420d11e7cae9d407a79d8925cfaff2d.avif?t=1788276914\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/extras_big/3420d11e7cae9d407a79d8925cfaff2d.webp?t=1788276914 width=1560 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/extras/0f834b448f2ac3051a1cea48c2304178.poster.avif?t=1788276914\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/extras/0f834b448f2ac3051a1cea48c2304178.webm?t=1788276914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/extras/0f834b448f2ac3051a1cea48c2304178.mp4?t=1788276914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover Secrets:</strong> Every room hides secrets waiting to be found. Explore beyond the obvious and uncover hidden areas that reward curiosity with rare items and untold stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kill Streak:</strong> Defeating enemies increases your damage output, but healing resets your streak. Push your limits or play it safe; the choice is yours every fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brush of Kumbu:</strong> Some enemies appear shrouded in the mysterious corruption, absorbing almost all damage dealt to them. A single stroke of the Kumbu brush shatters the shield, exposing them fully. Upgrade and master the brush alongside your weapons to craft the ultimate build.</p>", "short_description": "Slash, shoot, and restore myths and beasts in fluid, fast roguelite combat through a stunning hand-drawn watercolor world, where legends and even Orishas are going rogue in fear of being forgotten.", "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/42a83b8be0585685ba0b24d1fb0e978a626ef395/header.jpg?t=1788276914", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/e07531961f2de8eef029c0dbcfb99c8e11dcb2d5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788276914", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/e07531961f2de8eef029c0dbcfb99c8e11dcb2d5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788276914", "website": "https://playacclaim.com/talaka/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.1 GHz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Onboard audio<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Gamepad Recommended</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor a